[2026-01-30T16:43:39.011Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Execute this requirement immediately without asking questions.\n\n## REQUIREMENT\n\n# Cards Are Universal Containers With Pluggable Content\n\n## Metadata\n- **Category**: functionality\n- **Effort**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Impact**: Unknown (N/A/3)\n- **Scan Type**: insight_synth\n- **Generated**: 1/30/2026, 1:22:17 AM\n\n## Description\nFindingCard, SourceRow, EntityCard, ContradictionCard, GapCard, CausalChainCard, and PerspectiveCard all follow the same pattern: header with metadata badges, expandable body, optional sub-items. Abstract into a UniversalCard component with slots for header, badges, body, and actions.\n\n## Reasoning\nSix different card types implementing the same expand/collapse pattern with slight variations is a code smell. A universal card would reduce code by 60%, ensure visual consistency, and make adding new content types trivial - just define the slots.\n\n## Context\n\n**Note**: This section provides supporting architectural documentation and is NOT a hard requirement. Use it as guidance to understand existing code structure and maintain consistency.\n\n### Context: Report Tabs\n\n**Description**: Tab-based navigation components for quick-access report sections. Provides compact, scannable summaries for overview, findings, sources, entities, analysis, and perspectives.\n**Related Files**:\n- `src/components/report/tabs/OverviewTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/FindingsTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/SourcesTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/EntitiesTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/AnalysisTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/PerspectivesTab.tsx`\n- `src/components/report/tabs/index.tsx`\n\n**Post-Implementation**: After completing this requirement, evaluate if the context description or file paths need updates. Use the appropriate API/DB query to update the context if architectural changes were made.\n\n## Recommended Skills\n\n- **compact-ui-design**: Use `.claude/skills/compact-ui-design.md` for high-quality UI design references and patterns\n\n## Notes\n\nThis requirement was generated from an AI-evaluated project idea. No specific goal is associated with this idea.\n\n## AFTER IMPLEMENTATION\n\n1. Log your implementation using the `log_implementation` MCP tool with:\n   - requirementName: the requirement filename (without .md)\n   - title: 2-6 word summary\n   - overview: 1-2 paragraphs describing what was done\n\n2. Check for test scenario using `check_test_scenario` MCP tool\n   - If hasScenario is true, call `capture_screenshot` tool\n   - If hasScenario is false, skip screenshot\n\n3. Verify: `npx tsc --noEmit` (fix any type errors)\n\nBegin implementation now."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bb700aba-f9fc-4283-93cf-561e37220b63","uuid":"2c16ae73-689c-4a11-8355-df638be7f1ce","isSynthetic":true}
