[2026-01-30T16:49:33.818Z] [STDOUT] {"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-5-20251101","id":"msg_01TQAmJeZnktdDT9z8v6xhCA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Implementation Complete\n\nI've successfully implemented the **UniversalCard** component as a universal container with pluggable content slots. Here's a summary:\n\n### Created: `src/components/report/shared/UniversalCard.tsx`\n\n**Main Component:**\n- `UniversalCard` - A composable card with slots for header, badges, body, actions, footer, and sub-items\n\n**Preset Variants:**\n- `FindingCardWrapper`, `ContradictionCardWrapper`, `GapCardWrapper`, `CausalChainCardWrapper`, `EntityCardWrapper`, `PerspectiveCardWrapper`\n\n**Sub-components for common patterns:**\n- `CardBadgeRow` - Badge container\n- `CardMetaRow` - Metadata row (timestamps, counts)\n- `CardDataPanel` - Extracted data panel\n- `CardSourcesPanel` - Sources list panel\n- `CardConflictDisplay` - Claim A vs Claim B layout\n- `CardChainDisplay` - Horizontal chain visualization\n- `CardInsightsList` - Insights/warnings/recommendations list\n\n### Refactored Files:\n| File | Cards Refactored |\n|------|-----------------|\n| `FindingsTab.tsx` | FindingCard |\n| `EntitiesTab.tsx` | EntityCard |\n| `AnalysisTab.tsx` | ContradictionCard, GapCard, CausalChainCard |\n| `PerspectivesTab.tsx` | ComparisonCard, PerspectiveCard |\n\n### Features:\n- **5 color variants**: default, info, success, warning, danger\n- **Custom colorScheme** support for specialized cards\n- **Theme-aware** (swiss/radar themes)\n- **Expand/collapse** with smooth animations (framer-motion)\n- **Focus state** for keyboard navigation\n- **Controlled or uncontrolled** expansion state\n- **Composable slots**: header, badges, actions, body, footer, subItems\n\nThe abstraction reduces code duplication across 6 card types while maintaining visual consistency and making it trivial to add new content types by just defining the slots."}],"stop_r